2svh]\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-page-hero\"><img data-cstd-page-hero-image=\"true\" alt=\"连接多个真实产品的广播枢纽\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 48%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-broadcast-nexus-v1.webp\"/><div data-cstd-page-hero-overlay=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.96)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.78)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.18)_100%)]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-grid=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 [background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:64px_64px]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-material=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-artifacts=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"neon\" class=\"cstd-deep-neon-rig\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-index\">CSTD / 轨迹 09</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-coordinate\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">信号已锁定</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">冥府档案 / 工坊 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">经试炼，方可归返</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">星界旅记 / 判定 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">选择落笔，旅程成章</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">01 / SHIPPED SYSTEMS</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">作品不是截图，是一连串可解释的决定。</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">六个案例覆盖内容产品、AI 研究、创作工作台、业务系统、确定性计算与摄影服务。每个案例都记录问题、约束、架构、证据与复盘。</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->向下滚动 / 继续查看</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c]/88\"><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/alpha-research-system\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">01</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">证据管线 / 决策工作台</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CSTD Alpha 研究系统</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">把“问一句出一篇报告”拆成可回看的研究流程：来源、异步任务、估值版本和反证条件都跟着结果保存。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">产品、全栈、数据管线与 AI 编排</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">私有生产系统<!-- --> · <!-- -->112<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-alpha-research-system\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha 公司研究界面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->ALPHA</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/cfzzs-crm\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">02</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">业务系统 / 权限与并发</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CFZZS 招商 CRM</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">给产业园区招商团队用的一套线索工作台：从企业查重、阶段推进到空间资源和导出，关键状态都能追溯。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">需求拆解、全栈实现与生产验收</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">线上运行<!-- --> · <!-- -->102<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-cfzzs-crm\"><img alt=\"CFZZS 招商 CRM 仪表盘\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 26%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/crm.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->CRM</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/creative-workbench\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">03</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">生成式媒体 / 私有工作流</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">CSTD Design 创作工作台</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">一个给自己使用的中文创作工作台：对话可以分支，图片和视频任务可以恢复，素材始终找得到来源。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">产品、交互、全栈与安全</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">私有生产系统<!-- --> · <!-- -->100<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-creative-workbench\"><img alt=\"CSTD Design 创作工作台\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 20%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/design.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->DESIGN</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/dcf-quantum\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">04</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">确定性金融计算 / 本地软件</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">DCF Quantum</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">一套能在本机运行的三情景 DCF 筛选器：把数据口径、缓存、运行清单和 Windows 交付放在同一条研究流程里。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">产品、Python 内核、性能与桌面交付</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">本地发布<!-- --> · <!-- -->108<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-dcf-quantum\"><img alt=\"确定性金融数据计算舱\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-data-vault-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->DCF</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">05</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">开放数据分析 / 可复现 R 管线</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">墨尔本行人 × 微气候</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">把墨尔本 CBD 三个官方开放数据源清洗、空间连接并建模成一条可复现的分析管线：147 万行行人记录，在 150 米匹配规则下遇见微气候。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">独立完成：问题定义、数据清洗、空间连接、建模、可视化与报告</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">可复现分析管线<!-- --> · <!-- -->102<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"墨尔本 CBD 行人活动的星期×小时热力图\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,transparent_35%,rgba(36,224,255,0.12))] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 bg-[#050709]/90 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] backdrop-blur\">VERIFIED SURFACE / <!-- -->MELBOURNE-OPEN-DATA</figcaption></figure></a></article><article class=\"group relative border-t border-white/12 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"relative mx-auto grid min-h-[34rem] max-w-[1540px] overflow-hidden px-5 py-16 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-inset focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.88fr)_minmax(28rem,1.12fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-16\" href=\"/work/portrait-booking\"><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#778286]\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">06</span><span>2026</span><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-white/15\"></span></div><p class=\"mt-8 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\">服务设计 / 预约与视觉</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-white md:text-6xl\">奶黄包摄影体验</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-[#aab3b6]\">让访客从看照片、选服务一路走到预约；客户账户、活动、浏览器修图和后台管理共享同一份服务状态。</p><dl class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">角色</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">体验设计、前后端与沉浸式视觉</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#677379]\">状态</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-[#d9dfe1]\">线上运行<!-- --> · <!-- -->94<!-- -->s film</dd></div></dl><span class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#f4d431] pb-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-white transition-[gap,color] group-hover:gap-5 group-hover:text-[#f4d431]\">打开案例<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div><figure class=\"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden border border-white/18 bg-black shadow-[0_32px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.48)] lg:mt-0\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-case-portrait-booking\"><img alt=\"奶黄包摄影主页\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 28%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/photogra